{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">美银：CoreWeave电力扩张驱动增长与利润率提升</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>研报最值得看的判断，不是CoreWeave二季度收入又翻了一倍，而是公司把全年增长预期从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">145%</span>上调到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">150%</span>、运营利润率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.0%</span>微升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.2%</span>的同时，把全年资本开支指引从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">325亿美元</span>提高到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">370亿美元</span>。收入、利润、资本开支三个数字同时往上走，背后指向同一个驱动变量：可用电力（active power）的扩张速度比预期更快。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>末CoreWeave的可用电力从1GW增加到1.5GW，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">50%</span>，其中500MW新增里有300MW是在6月单月完成的。公司把全年可用电力指引从1.7GW以上提高到1.85GW以上。这个节奏意味着，数据中心从建设到通电投产的周期在缩短，而不是订单需求在膨胀——虽然订单也在膨胀。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX4xhCaECPia7gJdcjEfu4tRticz3vYzLIA7xakia1Jibcajd8aydTewtHUIyh7XW55KOzsu06taVUC2agrvkZatLSdR2PYMUzUsLA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">112%</span>，但更关键的是订单确认速度</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25.75亿美元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">112.3%</span>，略高于市场预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">111%</span>。运营利润率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，比市场预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.8%</span>高出220个基点。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>把超预期归因于产能的实质性增加，而不是价格提升或成本改善。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">剩余履约义务（RPO）达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1042亿美元</span>，环比增加约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40亿美元</span>。更值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的是，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>初又签了超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">250亿美元</span>的新承诺，这部分还没有计入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>的RPO。把这两个数字放在一起看，CoreWeave的订单池其实在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">加速</span>累积，但RPO环比增速从一季度的48.8%节奏变化到4.8%，说明大量订单正在从签约状态转化为实际收入。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看RPO增速节奏变化这个数字，它不代表需求变弱，而是订单确认收入的速度在加快。简单说，RPO是蓄水池，收入是出水口，出水口变大的同时水池还在涨，说明进水更快；后续更值得看的是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>那<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">250亿美元</span>新订单里有多少能在年内转化为收入。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVAcyibW7u7wr10995BEmibu0E3z52Lu78sRktJicFuZc9HBVNbkCqmOTey5whN532KfXIusobWtxl73dpK5KtIiawcUZWUThAbWg0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 资本开支上调至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">370亿美元</span>，电力供给决定交付上限</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>资本开支<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">94亿美元</span>，高于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">80亿美元</span>。全年资本开支指引从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">325亿美元</span>上调到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">370亿美元</span>，上调幅度<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">45亿美元</span>。BofA据此把三季度和四季度的资本开支预期分别调整到125亿美元和83亿美元。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">资本开支上调的直接原因是可用电力目标提高。年底目标从1.7GW以上提高到1.85GW以上，意味着下半年还要新增约350MW。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>预计这些新增产能会集中在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>落地。这里需要留意的是，CoreWeave的资本开支节奏和传统云厂商不同——它不是按季度平滑投入，而是跟着电力交付节点走，所以单季波动会很大。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">签约电力从季度末的3.7GW增加到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>初的4.2GW，管理层还提到目前有约1.5GW的额外容量可选。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>认为这支撑了公司<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2030年</span>底实现8GW可用电力的目标。把签约电力和可用电力放在一起看，中间还有约2.7GW的缺口，这就是未来几个季度的交付任务。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWMWHkybib8HfACCjUsNwliaIGogBg8ZiaMuX3WSl1lvdPBAg3kz8KeZYHZXWGgqOWGARY06vwQbGHRrfF1sDia0eW0m3Wc2VzW3mE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 合同宏观环境性<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>，7月提价<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>支撑利润率上行</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>运营利润率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">BofA</span>预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>提升到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.6%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">四季度</span>达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.6%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVEEqA7b3EiaU63auIayZJeMfRWic5XjOWGtF5BLPvpol5OrPTOZsFEqth5ZgQwpb6OjXGzQzP1m9X0YibibTzT3uWxhb6kPKia4icjg/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 13-Bofa-Coreweave Active power expansion drives higher growth and stronger margin outlook-260812</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
